==== CinaToken modifications ====

CinaToken selectively adapts the upstream theme-provider, responsive shell,
navigation, and visual-token patterns. Authentication, authorization,
accounting, API routes, Cloudflare deployment, and product branding are
CinaToken implementations and are not represented as upstream New API code.
